white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"start\":210},{\"end\":102,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:0:102:sha256-d5352952c35d27ead43ba84f11e560e73e7604cc8f5e1991855c69f726f1417f\",\"quote\":\"d. Infants pose a particular challenge. The goal is the best likeness that can reasonably be obtained:\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":370,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:210:370:sha256-615c651d3b77c0f73dc1b570db8afa27e4e440edc5aa00caf57180a91c60f03d\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"start\":210}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:8faa9aa913108666c7891ef6da884eb0c802deea9f5d0b9980601f33777bd521\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f22e6479b11eb27ecc7b0d64e618105a12125b4c3b9976fe8789e34db389330c\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"modality_quote\":\"may\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:d4a0dbdd88bed795e65ac3fe4916f49767d1da5d225ed56c968913bebecfc0b1\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:a01d74c2a12e8b6eaa