ined:\",\"start\":0},{\"end\":370,\"field\":\"scope_text:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:210:370:sha256-615c651d3b77c0f73dc1b570db8afa27e4e440edc5aa00caf57180a91c60f03d\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"start\":210},{\"end\":102,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:0:102:sha256-d5352952c35d27ead43ba84f11e560e73e7604cc8f5e1991855c69f726f1417f\",\"quote\":\"d. Infants pose a particular challenge. The goal is the best likeness that can reasonably be obtained:\",\"start\":0}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:638e9155a11b5ad2ac77fcc62cdb7fe6fbe13666256f9943a9f3edd52d05a87b\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:f6a14e9789abfde2d944e0d0c74d9dbd657ba1b027f9ddbc21c3d245b12f3d2f\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"modality_quote\":\"is acceptable\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:86bbfa0503b81ea9d8db36deaf5d40bce9a68e7722c777c4346d2567dae7818c\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., a car seat with a white or off-white blanket behind the child. Head tilt is acceptable for infants; and\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:1e56da23cd6b24348724b30d5561bb79f43b5c85937596940a00c51c8aad3ae1\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"d. Infants pose a particular challenge. The goal is the best likeness that can reasonably be obtained:\",\"(2) The infant's head may be discreetly supported, e.g., 