      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:be9b057f66af622903711f3303e5af03dd5c7cc7ecc651cd0fe9aaf5c99bccd6\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:bc81f724cf82bd5b241ca2da33d9bf88a7fa8737536ab1054a43bf3328f1b924\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:76007b3968c09cf788b691dc09c9a22070254d7797e40c71634c0d7f150b0d6e\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:a0d261250d8d2caea06879d2edda4e7b28f00acbdbb3acfeea55630e0b23b271\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:84cc02b4cde180e7d3c6fa0b2d08259d0635f13d10feb87b490cb3db60fc5e86\"],\"choice_quote\":\"\",\"choice_text\":\"\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":941,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":604,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:598:604:sha256-f86b1f62a8554232b940f4fd9c8d6601aae4767456df3d6cdff55a51f17b5075\",\"quote\":\"should\",\"start\":598},{\"end\":539,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:436:539:sha256-7f0fa99d97951a139f33ec44a19b323846e2dfb0edb6a59ea10b8060a5799c86\",\"quote\":\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"start\":436},{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"scope_text:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":539,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:436:539:sha256-7f0fa99d97951a139f33ec44a19b323846e2dfb0edb6a59ea10b8060a5799c86\",\"quote\":\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"start\":436}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:73429ef6f63bff426875ac9525258b8743c49a1c9226b907a42d3586c9cb4ef9\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"recommendation\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:84cc02b4cde180e7d3c6fa0b2d08259d0635f13d10feb87b490cb3db60fc5e86\",\"modality\":\"should\",\"modality_quote\":\"should\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:6be739491bd6ffd692e57542f38f4b29702b012fe5c2c660e22027ca398606b5\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"references\":[\"22 CFR 51.26\"],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:7a4c7a91af58a83faff44b5cdf102fc1d8ee65feaab046673fb23c909677d324\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a submitted passport photograph.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":579,\"summary\":\"The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of, and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
