      "dcterms:description": "{\"action\":\"\",\"actor\":\"\",\"alternative_quotes\":[\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\"],\"applies_to\":[],\"assertion_ids\":[\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:8e58f17f94a60722dd9823cf9658390463f7bf360b7bfc4bf887a096f41c3d5d\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:1d81a1ae53a351ed65a9872553c3fa209df0bceef6d98feb6b2f7fa08f747f8c\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:d33a670aac1bef106fb00c1a715e550c21f273c84419ed95e7fdcff8b7e0e90b\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:24e5f79d1c88057efcaea743c0953515b4f329ea5495e7cd809021aa24eb10ae\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:ea8b71dc5c39935d332d2f67c64e339c52dcda2d8ad6b53c64214baf49868218\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:46c8f05ace3c4523973b4ec5ece84c56752f86e520cc7883e7dbd2ae7b5f490a\",\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3919be076e5acefb4f7ebc9c1ddbb90fb1f57b6f3d038f310ede88d86a67f285\"],\"choice_quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"choice_text\":\"hairstyle or facial hair\",\"claimants\":[],\"concepts\":[],\"context_quotes\":[\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\"],\"effective_periods\":[],\"end\":941,\"evidence\":[{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"summary\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"logic_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":892,\"field\":\"modality\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:879:892:sha256-a156122d25a5c375ec3fb886fa5296b6a927c59712da371c087295514fd48ebc\",\"quote\":\"is acceptable\",\"start\":879},{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"choice_text\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":539,\"field\":\"scope_text:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:436:539:sha256-7f0fa99d97951a139f33ec44a19b323846e2dfb0edb6a59ea10b8060a5799c86\",\"quote\":\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"start\":436},{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"scope_text:1\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579},{\"end\":539,\"field\":\"context:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:436:539:sha256-7f0fa99d97951a139f33ec44a19b323846e2dfb0edb6a59ea10b8060a5799c86\",\"quote\":\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"start\":436},{\"end\":941,\"field\":\"alternative:0\",\"fragment_id\":\"urn:rkaf:fragment:urn%3Arulespec%3Adocument-understanding%3Adocument%3A1a47a76c521a93dcac7e7e6d3fb8e2bcef821725a1aa174ee419d39827b0ff4a:579:941:sha256-b7b80f97588d13e2422c19992c15f3262fd999e2e3c0966b293b10977eb6bdd9\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"start\":579}],\"id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:revision:42d3c21cdfc24dcc629b68d3e6ba3c03a66fd062f089255388f9171742a19a07\",\"jurisdiction\":\"\",\"jurisdiction_quote\":\"\",\"kind\":\"permission\",\"logic_text\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"meaning_assertion_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:assertion:3919be076e5acefb4f7ebc9c1ddbb90fb1f57b6f3d038f310ede88d86a67f285\",\"modality\":\"may\",\"modality_quote\":\"is acceptable\",\"object\":\"\",\"occurrence_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:occurrence:d14838036bb29a438b527e033d97a9ef34b62bfabb0d002e99eb952fa699d873\",\"origin\":\"aiSuggested\",\"quote\":\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\",\"references\":[],\"relation\":\"none\",\"rule_id\":\"urn:rulespec:document-understanding:rule:11160ed0b618c97d29b70718f7ec31f6d8667ea469899de45e142b144e022bbb\",\"scope_quotes\":[\"You must request a new photograph if the photograph submitted does not meet the following requirements:\",\"(2) The photograph should be taken within six months of submitting the application, be a good likeness of and satisfactorily identify the applicant at the time of the application (see 22 CFR 51.26). A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant;\"],\"scope_text\":\"For a submitted photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the submitted identification document, provided that it still is a good likeness of the applicant.\",\"section_id\":\"section-1\",\"start\":579,\"summary\":\"A photograph showing a change in hairstyle or facial hair from the identification document submitted is acceptable if it still is a good likeness of the applicant.\",\"target_ids\":[],\"typed_values\":[]}",
